OL,3,GNEWSASeeing #5m market hall empty is
OL,4,A'heart-wrenching'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sight of a market hall standing
OL,7,Fempty for months after a #5m
OL,8,Frefurbishment is "heart-wrenching" to
OL,9,Fone former trader there.
OL,11,FDiane Smith said she could not
OL,12,Funderstand why Teignbridge District
OL,13,FCouncil had not got an operator for
OL,14,FMarket Hall in Newton Abbot in place
OL,15,Fafter the #5m refit was finished in
OL,16,FJune.
OL,18,FThe Liberal Democrat deputy leader of
OL,19,Fthe council said it was crucial for the
OL,20,Fcouncil to carry out due diligence and
OL,21,Foperators wanted to wait until work was
OL,22,Ffinished before doing any deal.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
