OL,3,GNEWSASeeing #5m market hall empty is
OL,4,A'heart-wrenching'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe market will not be open until
OL,7,Fspring 2027 at the earliest and the
OL,8,FIndependent group on the council won a
OL,9,Fvote on Thursday to demand a full
OL,10,Fdebate of what has happened which will
OL,11,Ftake place in January.
